			"notes": "First release for Minecraft 26.3 with Fabric Loader 0.19.5 or newer.\n\n- Hold `C` to zoom, scroll to change magnification (2x to 10x, starts at 4x).\n- Mouse sensitivity scales with the zoom, no cinematic smoothing.\n- Bow draw and sprint do not shift the zoomed view.\n- Client only, no Fabric API needed.\n\nInstall: put `betterfine-1.0.0.jar` in the `mods` folder of a Fabric 26.3 instance. See the README for Prism and official launcher steps."
